    - languageCode: ru
      key: "\u041C\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0430\u0436"
  costExp: 30
  iconStory: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 737d5bb600763df439ec9c2f2d6d1f80, type: 3}
  localizator:
    translationJson: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 68395681354f1184b86edecdb84e363b, type: 3}
    _translator:
      languages:
      - languageCode: en
        messages:
        - key: Oh, hey! What are you doing here?
        - key: "Hi! I work part-time on the \nweekends as a masseur sometimes. \nIt
            pays pretty well."
        - key: "I signed up for a relaxing \nfull-body massage. I hope you're \ngood
            at it and you know \nhow to please a girl."
        - key: "Actually, this is a classic \nmassage parlor. And I take my work
            \nvery seriously, if you're \nimplying anything more."
        - key: "Oh, really? But, uh, are you \nsure a towel won't get in your way?"
        - key: Shut up and let me do my job!
        - key: "Oh, no! Ben, please don't do this! \nI haven't had anal yet."
        - key: "I told you to shut up \nand let me do my work!"
        - key: "Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah..... \nMmmmm..... Just don't stop!"
      - languageCode: ru
        messages:
        - key: "\u041E \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442! \u0427\u0442\u043E \u0442\u044B
            \u0442\u0443\u0442 \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C?"
        - key: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442! \u042F \u0438\u043D\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430
            \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0431\u0430\u0442\u044B\u0432\u0430\u044E
            \n\u043F\u043E \u0432\u044B\u0445\u043E\u0434\u043D\u044B\u043C \u043C\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043E\u043C.
            \n\u0417\u0430 \u044D\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0435\u043F\u043B\u043E\u0445\u043E
            \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u044F\u0442."
        - key: "\u042F \u0437\u0430\u043F\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043B\u0430\u0441\u044C
            \u043D\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043B\u0430\u0431\u043B\u044F\u044E\u0449\u0438\u0439
            \n\u043C\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0430\u0436 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u043E
            \u0442\u0435\u043B\u0430. \u041D\u0430\u0434\u0435\u044E\u0441\u044C
            \n\u0442\u044B \u043C\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0435\u0440 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0433\u043E
            \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430 \n\u0438 \u0443\u043C\u0435\u0435\u0448\u044C
            \u0434\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043B\u044F\u0442\u044C \n\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0432\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435
            \u0434\u0435\u0432\u0443\u0448\u043A\u0430\u043C?"
        - key: "\u0412\u043E\u043E\u0431\u0449\u0435-\u0442\u043E \u044D\u0442\u043E
            \u0441\u0430\u043B\u043E\u043D \u043A\u043B\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E
            \n\u043C\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0430\u0436\u0430. \u0418 \u044F \u043E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C
            \u0441\u0435\u0440\u044C\u0435\u0437\u043D\u043E \n\u043E\u0442\u043D\u043E\u0448\u0443\u0441\u044C
            \u043A \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0435,
            \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \n\u0442\u044B \u043D\u0430\u043C\u0435\u043A\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C
            \u043D\u0430 \u0447\u0442\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0435\u0435."
        - key: "\u041D\u0435\u0442 \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u044B? \u041D\u043E,
            \u0442\u044B \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043D, \n\u0447\u0442\u043E
            \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0442\u0435\u043D\u0446\u0435 \u043D\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0435\u0442
            \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435?"
        - key: "\u041F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u043B\u0447\u0438 \u0438 \u043D\u0435 \u043C\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0439
            \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C!"
        - key: "\u041E\u043E\u043E\u043E, \u043D\u0435\u0442! \u0411\u0435\u043D,
            \u043F\u043E\u0436\u0430\u043B\u0443\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0430 \n\u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E
            \u043D\u0435 \u044D\u0442\u043E! \u042F \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435
            \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0430 \u0430\u043D\u0430\u043B."
        - key: "\u042F \u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043A\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043B \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435
            \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u043B\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044C \n\u0438 \u043D\u0435
            \u043C\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0442\u044C \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C!"
        - key: "\u041E \u0434\u0430\u0430\u0430\u0430\u2026. \u041C\u043C\u043C\u043C\u043C\u2026..
            \n\u0422\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u043D\u0435 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043D\u0430\u0432\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044F!"
      - languageCode: de
        messages:
        - key: Oh, hey! Was machst du denn hier?
        - key: "Hi! Ich bin manchmal ein \nWochenend-Masseur. Es \nwird ziemlich
            gut bezahlt."
        - key: "Ich habe mich f\xFCr eine entspannende \nGanzk\xF6rpermassage angemeldet.
            Ich hoffe, \ndu bist gut in dem, was du tust, \nund du wei\xDFt, wie
            man Frauen befriedigt."
        - key: "Eigentlich ist dies ein klassischer \nMassagesalon. Und ich nehme
            meinen \nJob sehr ernst, falls du \netwas anderes andeuten willst."
        - key: "Oh, wirklich? Aber bist du sicher, \ndass dir kein Handtuch in die
            \nQuere kommen wird?"
        - key: "Halt die Klappe und \nlass mich meine Arbeit machen!"
        - key: "Oh, nein! Ben, bitte tu das nicht! \nIch hatte noch keinen Analverkehr."
        - key: "Ich habe dir gesagt, du sollst \ndie Klappe halten und mich arbeiten
            lassen!"
        - key: "Oh, ja.... Mmmmm..... H\xF6r \neinfach nicht auf!"
      - languageCode: fr
        messages:
        - key: "Oh, hey ! Qu'est-ce \nque tu fais ici ?"
        - key: "Bonjour ! Je suis masseur \nle week-end parfois. \xC7a paye plut\xF4t
            bien."
        - key: "Je me suis inscrite pour un massage \nrelaxant de tout le corps.
            J'esp\xE8re que vous \n\xEAtes bon dans ce que vous faites et que \nvous
            savez comment plaire aux filles."
        - key: "En fait, c'est un salon \nde massage classique. Et je prends \nmon
            travail tr\xE8s au s\xE9rieux, \nsi vous insinuez quelque chose de plus."
        - key: "Oh, vraiment ? Mais vous\n \xEAtes s\xFBr de ne pas laisser \nune
            serviette vous g\xEAner ?"
        - key: "Taisez-vous et laissez-moi \nfaire mon travail !"
        - key: "Oh, non ! Ben, s'il te pla\xEEt, \nne fais pas \xE7a ! Je n'ai \npas
            encore eu d'anal."
        - key: "Je t'ai dit de te taire \net de me laisser travailler !"
        - key: "Oh, yeah.... Mmmmm..... \nNe t'arr\xEAte pas !"
      - languageCode: it
        messages:
        - key: Oh, ehi! Che ci fai qui?
        - key: "Ciao! A volte faccio il massaggiatore \nnei weekend. Mi pagano abbastanza
            bene."
        - key: "Ho firmato per un massaggio rilassante \nsu tutto il corpo. Spero
            che tu sia \nbravo in quello che fai e che tu \nsappia come soddisfare
            le ragazze."
        - key: "In realt\xE0, questo \xE8 un classico \ncentro massaggi. E prendo
            il mio \nlavoro molto seriamente, se \nsta insinuando qualcosa di pi\xF9."
        - key: "Oh, davvero? Ma \xE8 sicuro \nche non si lascer\xE0 intralciare \nda
            un asciugamano?"
        - key: Zitto e lasciami fare il mio lavoro!
        - key: "Oh, no! Ben, ti prego, non farlo! \nNon ho ancora fatto sesso anale."
        - key: "Ti ho detto di stare zitto \ne lasciarmi lavorare!"
        - key: Oh, si'! Mmmmm..... Non fermarti!
      - languageCode: sp
        messages:
        - key: "\xA1Hola! \xBFQu\xE9 haces aqu\xED?"
        - key: "\xA1Hola! A veces soy masajista de \nfin de semana. Me pagan bastante
            bien."
        - key: "Me he apuntado a un masaje relajante \nde cuerpo entero. Espero que
            seas \nbueno en lo que haces y que \nsepas complacer a las chicas."
        - key: "En realidad, este es un sal\xF3n \nde masajes cl\xE1sico. Y me tomo
            mi trabajo \nmuy en serio, si insin\xFAas algo m\xE1s."
        - key: "\xBFAh, s\xED? \xBFPero est\xE1s seguro \nde que no vas a dejar que
            \nuna toalla se interponga?"
        - key: "\xA1C\xE1llate y d\xE9jame hacer mi trabajo!"
        - key: "\xA1Oh, no! \xA1Ben, por favor \nno hagas esto! Todav\xEDa \nno he
            tenido sexo anal."
        - key: "\xA1Te dije que te callaras \ny me dejaras trabajar!"
        - key: "Oh, s\xED.... Mmmmm..... \n\xA1No pares!"
